\p
\v 5 It¦37310 started with the priest¦37319 Zekaryah \add !(Zechariah)\add* and his wife¦37328 Elizabeth at the time¦37313 when Herod¦37314 was the king¦37316 of¦37318 Yudea¦37318. (Zekaryah¦37322 was in the priestly division¦37324 of¦37325 Abiyah, and¦37326 Elizabeth was also a descendant of¦37334 Aaron¦37334.)\x + \xo 1:5: \xt 1Ch 24:10.\x*
