\v 7 Elizabeth¦37367 had never been¦37361 able to¦37362 have a child¦37363, so¦37370 there was¦37378 just the¦37375 two of¦37377 them¦37377 as they were now getting older.
\p
\v 8 One time¦37382 as he was taking his rostered turn to¦37383 serve¦37383 \nd God¦37394\nd* along with his division¦37389,
