\v 35 “\nd The¦37898\nd* holy¦37899 \nd spirit¦37898\nd* will¦37900 come¦37900 over¦37900 you¦37902,” answered¦37893 the¦37894 messenger¦37895, “and¦37903 the¦37904 power¦37904 of¦37905 the¦37905 highest¦37905 one will¦37906 overshadow¦37906 you¦37907, and¦37910 so the¦37911 holy¦37915 child¦37915 that'll be¦37912 born¦37912 will¦37916 be¦37916 called¦37916 \nd God's¦37918\nd* son¦37917.
