\v 38 “Listen¦37963,” said Maria¦37962, “I'm \nd Yahweh's\nd* servant¦37965 girl¦37965. May¦37967 everything you¦37972 said \add ≈come true\add*.” Then¦37973 the¦37978 messenger¦37979 left¦37975 her¦37977.
