\v 39 Several days¦37986 later, Maria¦37983 determined that she'd go¦37988 to¦37990 the¦37991 town¦37996 in the hills of¦37997 Yudea
\v 40 where Zekaryah¦38003 and¦37998 Elizabeth lived. She¦37999 entered¦37999 the¦38001 house¦38002 and¦38004 greeted¦38005 Elizabeth¦38007,
