\v 42 and¦38039 she¦38041 called¦38041 out¦38041 loudly¦38044, “Out of \add all\add* women¦38050, you¦38048 have¦38047 been¦38047 blessed¦38047 and¦38051 the baby in your¦38057 womb¦38056 has¦38052 been¦38052 blessed¦38052.
\v 43 How could this¦38061 happen to¦38060 me¦38060—that¦38062 the¦38064 mother¦38065 of¦38066 my¦38068 \nd master¦38067\nd* would come¦38063 and visit me¦38070!
