\p
\v 22 \wj Everything has been¦48272 handed¦48272 over¦48272 to¦48271 me¦48271 by¦48274 my¦48278 father¦48277, and¦48279 no¦48280 one¦48280 knows¦48282 who¦48283 the¦48285 son¦48286 is except¦48287 for the¦48289 father¦48290, and¦48291 who¦48292 the¦48294 father¦48295 is except¦48296 for the¦48298 son¦48299 and¦48300 those who¦48301 the¦48306 son¦48307 decides to¦48308 reveal¦48308 him to.\wj*”\x + \xo 10:22: a \xt Yhn 3:35; \xo b \xt Yhn 10:15.\x*
\p
