\v 38 When¦48646 it was time¦48648 to¦48649 leave¦48649, \add @Yeshua¦48653\add* went¦48654 into¦48657 a¦48658 village¦48658 and¦48661 there was a woman¦48660 there named¦48663 Martha¦48664 who welcomed¦48665 him¦48666 in.\x + \xo 10:38-39: \xt Yhn 11:1.\x*
\v 39 She¦48677 had a¦48678 sister¦48678 named¦48679 Maria¦48680 who¦48681 was also¦48682 sitting¦48684 there \add on the floor\add* by¦48684 \nd Yeshua's¦48692\nd* feet¦48688 listening¦48693 to his¦48697 teaching.
