\p
\v 1 One time¦48780 \add @Yeshua¦48782\add* was¦48781 at a¦48784 place¦48784 praying¦48786, and when¦48788 he¦48789 finished¦48789 some of¦48792 his followers¦48793 asked¦48790 him¦48796, “\nd Master¦48797\nd*, Yohan-the-immerser taught¦48798 his apprentices how to¦48800 pray¦48800. You teach us as¦48801 well.”
\p
\v 2 \add ≈So¦48810\add* \add @Yeshua¦48809\add* told¦48809 them¦48812, “\wj Whenever¦48813 you¦48814 all¦48814 pray¦48814, say¦48832 this:\wj*
\q1 \wj Father¦48833, may \+add ≈all people honour you¦48842 as their holy God\+add*.\wj*
\q1 \wj May \+add ≈you¦48849 reign as king¦48848\+add* \+add over the earth\+add*.\wj*
\q1
\v 3 ⇔\wj Every¦48871 day¦48872 give¦48867 us the food¦48863 that¦48870 we need¦48866.\wj*
