\v 4 \wj Forgive¦48875 us¦48876 for our¦48881 sins¦48879 because¦48884 we've¦48888 forgiven¦48888 those who owed¦48892 \+add something\+add* to¦48893 us¦48893.\wj*
\q1 \wj Don't¦48896 bring¦48897 us¦48898 into¦48899 \+add situations where\+add* we're \+add ≈tempted¦48900\+add*.\wj*”
