\p
\v 5 Then¦48907 he¦48908 told¦48908 them¦48910, “\wj \+add Imagine\+add* you¦48913 had¦48914 a¦48915 friend¦48915 and¦48916 went¦48917 to¦48918 them at¦48920 midnight¦48920 and¦48922 asked¦48923, ‘Friend¦48927, lend¦48928 me¦48929 some bread\wj*
\v 6 \wj because¦48932 a¦48933 travelling friend¦48933 of¦48934 mine arrived¦48936 at my place, and¦48944 I haven't got anything to¦48949 give him¦48949 to eat.’\wj*
\v 7 \wj And¦48950 the one in the \+add other\+add* house might¦48956 reply, ‘Don't¦48958 bother me¦48959 \+add now\+add* because the¦48963 house is¦48966 locked and¦48967 the¦48968 kids¦48970 are¦48982 asleep beside me¦48973 here in¦48974 the¦48976 bed¦48978. I¦48986 can't¦48985 get up¦48988 and get anything¦48989 for you¦48990.’\wj*
\v 8 \wj I'm¦48991 telling¦48991 all¦48992 of you that even¦48994 if¦48993 that¦49000 friend¦49004 wouldn't get up and give them anything because¦49007 of¦49007 their friendship, then the¦49010 friend will¦49015 certainly get up and give¦49015 them \+add some food\+add* if they \+add ≈persist¦49011\+add* \+add in knocking\+add*.\wj*
\v 9 \wj \+add ≈So¦49021\+add* this is¦49023 what I'm telling¦49023 you¦49022: \+add Keep submitting\+add* your requests¦49026 and¦49027 it'll¦49028 be¦49028 given¦49028 to¦49029 you¦49029 all¦49029, keep searching¦49030 and¦49031 you'll¦49032 all¦49032 find¦49032 \+add what you're looking for\+add*, keep knocking¦49033 and¦49034 the door will¦49035 be¦49035 opened¦49035 for you¦49036 all¦49036,\wj*
\v 10 \wj because¦49038 everyone¦49037 who requests¦49040 will receive¦49041, and¦49042 everyone who searches¦49044 will find¦49045, and¦49046 everyone who knocks¦49048 will¦49049 find opened¦49049 \+add doors\+add*.\wj*
\v 11 \wj How many¦49056 of you¦49056 \+add #fathers¦49059\+add*, if \+add &your¦49061\+add* child¦49062 asked¦49060 you for \+add some\+add* fish, you'd give¦49083 them a¦49080 snake¦49080 instead¦49078?\wj*
