\v 13 \wj So¦49112 if¦49111 you¦49113 all¦49113 know¦49117 how to¦49121 give¦49121 good¦49119 things to¦49122 your children¦49123 despite your¦49124 being evil¦49114, how¦49125 much¦49125 more¦49126 the¦49127 father¦49128 in heaven¦49132 will¦49134 give¦49134 \+add the\+add* holy¦49137 \+nd spirit¦49135\+nd* to¦49139 those who¦49130 ask¦49140 him¦49141.\wj*”
