\v 7 \wj Then¦53916 he¦53919 asked¦53919 the next one, ‘How¦53922 much¦53922 do you¦53920 owe¦53923?’ ‘A¦53927 hundred¦53927 containers of¦53929 wheat¦53929,’ the man replied¦53933. ‘Get¦53936 the¦53939 contract form and¦53942 change it to eighty¦53944,’ said the manager.\wj*
