\v 14 \wj But¦57324 when the tenants¦57327 saw¦57323 the son, they reasoned¦57328 among themselves, ‘This¦57334 is¦57335 the¦57336 heir¦57337. If we¦57339 kill¦57339 him¦57340, then \+add &his¦57346\+add* inheritance¦57347 will become¦57345 ours.’\wj*
